{
  "name": "Tool - Agendar Reunion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🧩 Sub-agente: Agendar Reunión (Tool)\n\nQué hace:\n- Se ejecuta como *tool* desde el Agente principal.\n- Recibe `titulo`, `fecha` (YYYY-MM-DD), `hora` (HH:mm) y `duracion_minutos` (opcional, default 60).\n- Construye inicio/fin en ISO y crea el evento en Google Calendar.\n- Devuelve `resultado` (string) para el agente.\n\nImportante:\n- El agente debe haber consultado disponibilidad ANTES de llamar esta tool.\n- Acción que modifica el calendario: confirmar con el usuario antes de agendar.\n- Zona horaria fija en `startISO`: offset -06:00 (America/Mexico_City).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [128, -208],
      "id": "n1-overview-agendar",
      "name": "🟨 Nota - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "jsonExample",
        "jsonExample": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"Título del evento\",\n  \"fecha\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"hora\": \"HH:mm\",\n  \"duracion_minutos\": 60\n}"
      },
      "id": "n2-trigger-agendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "name": "When Executed by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "position": [800, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "start-time",
              "name": "startISO",
              "value": "={{ $json.fecha }}T{{ $json.hora }}:00-06:00",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "duration",
              "name": "duracion",
              "value": "={{ $json.duracion_minutos || 60 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "title",
              "name": "titulo",
              "value": "={{ $json.titulo }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1024, 80],
      "id": "n3-preparar-datos",
      "name": "Preparar Datos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "end-time",
              "name": "endISO",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.startISO).plus({minutes: $json.duracion}).toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1248, 80],
      "id": "n4-calcular-fin",
      "name": "Calcular Fin"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "TU_CALENDAR_ID@group.calendar.google.com",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Mi calendario"
        },
        "start": "={{ $('Preparar Datos').item.json.startISO }}",
        "end": "={{ $('Calcular Fin').item.json.endISO }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "description": "Creado por Asistente IA",
          "summary": "={{ $('Preparar Datos').item.json.titulo }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1472, 80],
      "id": "n5-crear-evento",
      "name": "Crear Evento",
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PEGA_TU_CREDENCIAL_GOOGLE_CALENDAR",
          "name": "Google Calendar account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "success",
              "name": "resultado",
              "value": "=📅 Reunión agendada: {{ $('Preparar Datos').item.json.titulo }} el {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.fecha }} de {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.hora }} a {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Calcular Fin').item.json.endISO).toFormat('HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1696, 80],
      "id": "n6-respuesta-agendar",
      "name": "Respuesta"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "When Executed by Another Workflow": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Preparar Datos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Preparar Datos": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Calcular Fin", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Calcular Fin": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Crear Evento", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Crear Evento": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respuesta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
